    "mainIdea": {
      "text": "When the remote rope of North Mountain’s warning bell breaks before a blizzard, Anna, Elsa, Ms. Lin, and 2 cross an Echo Bridge that turns spoken directions into paths. Their simultaneous commands split the bridge, and Anna’s haste combined with Elsa’s magical repair leaves them stranded. They recover by stopping, listening, and sharing observations one at a time. Then 2 locates the tower. Together, they confirm one instruction, which the bridge obeys. Elsa then supports their chosen route instead of choosing it. At the tower, they follow another shared plan: Elsa clears the frozen hammer, Anna and Ms. Lin pull its rope, and 2 signals during a lull. The warning reaches Arendelle in time, proving that one voice built from everyone’s evidence can guide coordinated action."
